## Why This Is Asked

Tests pragmatic cross-tenant least-privilege control and auditability for short-term access to a data workspace, combining PIM, Entitlement Management, Conditional Access, and cloud-native logs.

## Key Concepts

- Azure AD PIM: time-bound privileged access
- Azure AD entitlement management and B2B guest provisioning
- Conditional Access: MFA and device/compliance requirements
- Databricks workspace RBAC/Unity Catalog scoping
- Cross-tenant auditing: Azure AD Sign-ins, Databricks audit logs

